WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.425
Games are built from two kinds of parts: an interface, and rules.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.250
The interface is what you see: the status bar and buttons.

3
00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:14.654
One label function draws each part. Three calls, no copies.

4
00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:19.235
Rules decide what events mean: a miss costs a life.

5
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:24.665
A fair power-up is worth wanting, and costly enough to think about.
